@startuml
title Municipal Report Management System: component view (overview)
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

[Presentation layer\nSwing GUI screens] as ui
[Application layer\nServices facade] as facade
[Application layer\nUse-case controllers] as ctrl
[Domain layer\nDomain services] as dsvc
[Domain layer\nDomain entities] as model
[Persistence layer\nPersistence service] as persist
[MySQL database reports_db] as db

ui --> facade : request operations
ui --> ctrl : log in
ui ..> model : use ReportCategory
facade --> ctrl : delegate use cases
ctrl --> dsvc : invoke business logic
dsvc --> model : create and modify
dsvc --> persist : save, update, query
persist ..> model : map (JPA)
persist --> db : JDBC (MySQL)
@enduml
